(183,'INFRASTRUCTURE AS CODE Terraform & Ansible','iac-terroform-ansible','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 28.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #1f4e79;\">INFRASTRUCTURE AS CODE</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 22.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #2e75b6;\">Terraform &amp; Ansible</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #555555;\">Enterprise Implementation Guide</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #2e75b6;\">Platforms:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>AWS Cloud<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>|<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Oracle Cloud Infrastructure<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>|<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Proxmox On-Premises</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Prepared by: Krishnakumar</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #555555;\">Senior Linux Administrator / Head of Infrastructure &amp; Engineering</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #555555;\">Worktual Innovations Pvt Ltd, Chennai, India</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #1f4e79;\">1. Introduction to Infrastructure as Code (IaC)</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 2.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #222222;\">Infrastructure as Code (IaC) is the practice of managing and provisioning computing infrastructure through machine-readable configuration files rather than manual processes. It brings software engineering discipline &mdash; version control, testing, and CI/CD &mdash; directly to infrastructure management.</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #2e75b6;\">1.1 Why IaC Matters</span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoListBulletCxSpFirst\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; margin: 1.0pt 0cm 1.0pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Eliminates configuration drift between environments</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListBulletCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; margin: 1.0pt 0cm 1.0pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Enables repeatable, predictable deployments every time</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListBulletCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; margin: 1.0pt 0cm 1.0pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Provides full audit trail through version control (Git)</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListBulletCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; margin: 1.0pt 0cm 1.0pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Reduces human error in provisioning and configuration</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListBulletCxSpMiddle\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; margin: 1.0pt 0cm 1.0pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Allows infrastructure changes to go through code review</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListBulletCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 18.0pt; margin: 1.0pt 0cm 1.0pt 18.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\">Supports disaster recovery by recreating infrastructure from code</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #2e75b6;\">1.2 The Two Pillars: Terraform vs Ansible</span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 2.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #222222;\">While both tools are IaC tools, they serve fundamentally different and complementary purposes.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: white;\">Attribute</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: