windowtext;\">Infrastructure Provisioning</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; border-right: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Configuration Management</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; background: #EBF3FB; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Approach</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; border-right: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; background: #EBF3FB; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\