rmal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Proxmox REST API</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; border-right: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Used by Terraform Telmate provider</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; background: #EBF3FB; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Clustering</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; border-right: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; background: #EBF3FB; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Proxmox Cluster</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 156.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; border-right: solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid #AAAAAA .5pt; background: #EBF3FB; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"208\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">HA via corosync + pve-ha-manager</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #222222;\">6.2 Step 1 &mdash; Create API Token on Proxmox</span></h3>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\"># Run these commands on the Proxmox host (as root)</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;