e=\"font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #555555;\">Worktual Innovations Pvt Ltd, Chennai, India</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 14.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #1f4e79;\">1. Project Overview</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 2.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #222222;\">This document describes the Terraform configuration used to provision AWS infrastructure for the Worktual environment. The configuration is modular, uses dynamic AMI lookup, and is driven entirely by variables &mdash; making it reusable across environments (dev, staging, production) without code changes.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 14.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #2e75b6;\">1.1 What This Configuration Provisions</span></h2>