\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\"># terraform.tfvars<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>&mdash; gitignore this for production secrets</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\">aws_region<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>= \"ap-south-1\"</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\">instance_type = \"t3.medium\"</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\">environment<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>= \"production\"</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 2.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #222222;\">Method 2 &mdash; Command-line flags:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #2E75B6; margin: 8.0pt 0cm 0cm 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: white;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>CLI override</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\">terraform apply -var=\"environment=staging\" -var=\"instance_type=t3.small\"</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 2.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #222222;\">Method 3 &mdash; Environment variables:</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #2E75B6; margin: 8.0pt 0cm 0cm 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: white;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Shell environment variables</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\">export TF_VAR_environment=\"production\"</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\">export TF_VAR_instance_type=\"t3.large\"</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #1E1E1E; margin: 0cm 18.0pt 0cm 18.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Courier New\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #d4d4d4;\">terraform apply</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 468.0pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #D6EAF8; padding: 7.0pt 10.0pt 7.0pt 10.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"624\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #1f4e79;\">Precedence order (highest to lowest): CLI -var flag<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>&gt;<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>.tfvars file<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>&gt;<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>TF_VAR_ env vars<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>&gt;<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>variable default value</span></em></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 14.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #1f4e79;\">4. main.tf &mdash; Core Infrastructure Resources</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 2.0pt 0cm 4.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #222222;\">main.tf contains all the actual AWS resources. It uses the variables defined in variables.tf and references outputs between resources using interpolation syntax.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 14.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #2e75b6;\">4.1 Full File Content</span></h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #2E75B6; margin: 8.0pt 0cm 0cm 18.0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: white;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </sp