<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; color: #1B5E20;\">I\'m the right fit.</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-bottom: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">\n<h1 style=\"border: none; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">Chapter 7: Interview-Only WHY Questions &mdash; 17 Answers</h1>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt;\">\'WHY\' questions probe your motivation, alignment, and self-awareness more deeply than any other type. Here are all 17 with ideal concise answers &mdash; memorize and adapt them.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 468.0pt; margin-left: -.35pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"624\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Why Question</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Ideal Short Answer</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Extended Explanation</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you want this job?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">It aligns with my skills and pushes me to grow.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Connect the role requirements directly to your experience and career direction.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why should we hire you?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I\'m committed, reliable, and I deliver results.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Give 2-3 specific behaviors that prove this, not just claims.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why did you choose this company?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I admire its values and the work it stands for.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Reference something specific about the company &mdash; research shows genuine interest.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why are you changing jobs?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">For growth opportunities and new challenges.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Always frame as moving toward something, not away from something.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you want this role?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">It matches my experience and excites me.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Show you have read the JD carefully and can map your skills to the requirements.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why are you interested in this field?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I genuinely enjoy the work &mdash; it never feels routine.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Passion for your field signals long-term commitment to the employer.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you think you\'ll succeed here?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I adapt quickly and I\'ve proven that before.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Give a brief example of adapting to a new environment successfully.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why are you the right fit?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">My skills match the role requirements exactly.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mention 2-3 specific skills from the JD that you clearly possess.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you want professional growth?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">To add more value and expand my impact.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Growth framed as contribution to the company, not just personal gain.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you work well in teams?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I communicate clearly and I listen actively.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Interviewers want to know you are collaborative, not just a solo performer.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why should we trust you?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I take responsibility for my actions, always.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Accountability is the foundation of trust &mdash; and it is rare and valued.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why are you confident about this job?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I\'ve prepared thoroughly and know my strengths.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Confidence from preparation is respected. Overconfidence without basis is not.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you handle pressure well?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I stay focused on priorities and don\'t panic.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Give a brief example of performing under pressure if possible.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you value this opportunity?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">It directly supports my professional goals.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Shows you have thought about your career direction &mdash; not just any job.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why are you motivated to work?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I find meaning in doing work that matters.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Purpose-driven motivation is more sustainable and impressive than money.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you want long-term growth?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stability and progression both matter to me.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Shows you are not a flight risk &mdash; you want to build, not just pass through.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 17; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Why do you learn new skills?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 140.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"187\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">To stay relevant and keep adding value.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 188.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"251\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Commitment to learning signals adaptability &mdash; critical in fast-changing industries.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-bottom: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">\n<h1 style=\"border: none; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">Chapter 8: Level Up Your English &mdash; Don\'t Say vs. Say</h1>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt;\">These everyday English upgrades make you sound more professional and polished &mdash; both in interviews and in every professional interaction.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 468.0pt; margin-left: -.35pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"624\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">❌ Don\'t Say</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">✅ Say Instead</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Context</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I don\'t know.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I\'m not sure about that.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Sounds thoughtful rather than uninformed</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Wait a second.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Just a moment.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">More professional tone</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I think so.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">It seems likely.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">More confident phrasing</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I\'m busy.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I\'m tied up right now.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Professional and polite</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Can you repeat?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Could you say that again?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Polite request, not a demand</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I forgot.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">It slipped my mind.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Softer and more natural</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">No problem.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Not an issue at all.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">More emphatic and positive</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I don\'t like it.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">It\'s not really my preference.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Diplomatic and professional</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Hurry up.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Could you hurry a little?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Polite, not commanding</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">That\'s wrong.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">That doesn\'t seem right.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Opens dialogue rather than creating conflict</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I need help.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Could I get some assistance?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Professional request</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I don\'t understand.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Could you clarify that?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Shows engagement, not confusion</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">That\'s a bad idea.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I have some concerns about that approach.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Constructive rather than dismissive</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I can\'t do this.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">I\'d need more time or support for this.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Honest and solution-oriented</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">What do you want?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 150.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"200\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">How can I help you?</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 168.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"224\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Service-oriented and professional</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-bottom: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">\n<h1 style=\"border: none; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">Chapter 9: Professional Email Templates for Career Transitions</h1>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt;\">How you communicate in writing during career transitions reflects directly on your professionalism. These templates cover the key moments.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Template 1: Professional Goodbye Email to Colleagues</h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt; background: #1A1A2E;\"><strong><span style=\"color: white;\">Subject: Thank You &amp; Farewell</span></strong></p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-left: solid #C9A84C 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt; background: #F8F9FA;\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #C9A84C 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Dear Team,</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #C9A84C 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">As I move on from my role, I would like to take a moment to thank each of you for your support, collaboration, and the great experiences we have shared together.</span></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #C9A84C 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">It has been a genuine pleasure working with such a talented and supportive team. I truly appreciate everything I have learned during my time here.</span></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #C9A84C 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Wishing you all continued success ahead. I hope we stay in touch.</span></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #C9A84C 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Warm regards, [Your Name]</span></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Template 2: Post-Interview Thank You Email (Send Within 24 Hours)</h2>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5.0pt; background: #1A1A2E;\"><strong><span style=\"color: white;\">Subject: Thank You &mdash; [Your Name] | [Role] Interview</span></strong></p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-left: solid #1F4E79 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt; background: #F8F9FA;\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #1F4E79 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Dear [Interviewer\'s Name],</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #1F4E79 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Thank you for taking the time to meet with me today. I genuinely enjoyed our conversation and learning more about the team and the direction of [Company Name].</span></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #1F4E79 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">The discussion about [specific topic] reinforced my enthusiasm for the role. I am confident that my background in [relevant skill] would allow me to contribute meaningfully from day one.</span></em></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt; background: #F8F9FA; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #1F4E79 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Best regards, [Your Name] | [Phone] | [LinkedIn URL]</span></p>\n</div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-bottom: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">\n<h1 style=\"border: none; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">Chapter 10: The Complete Pre-Interview Checklist</h1>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt;\">Use this checklist before every interview. Preparation is the single biggest differentiator between candidates.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>One Week Before</h3>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Research the company thoroughly &mdash; products, services, recent news, culture, values</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Study the job description word by word &mdash; map your experience to each requirement</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Prepare 5&ndash;8 STAR stories (Situation, Task, Action, Result) from your career</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Practice your self-introduction out loud until it flows naturally in under 2 minutes</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Prepare 3&ndash;5 intelligent questions to ask the interviewer</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Research the interviewer\'s background on LinkedIn if you know their name</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>One Day Before</h3>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Confirm the interview time, location or video link, and interviewer\'s name</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Lay out your interview outfit &mdash; professional, clean, appropriate for the company culture</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Print extra copies of your resume &mdash; at least 3 copies</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Get a full night of sleep &mdash; mental sharpness matters more than last-minute cramming</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Review your prepared answers one final time, then stop &mdash; trust your preparation</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Day of the Interview</h3>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Eat a proper meal &mdash; low blood sugar affects clarity and confidence</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Arrive 10&ndash;15 minutes early &mdash; never late, never more than 20 minutes early</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Silence your phone completely before entering the building</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Greet the receptionist warmly &mdash; companies sometimes ask their opinion</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Take slow, deep breaths to manage nerves before entering the room</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>What NOT to Do During the Interview</h3>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"color: #C00000;\">NEVER speak negatively about a previous employer, manager, or colleague</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"color: #C00000;\">NEVER lie or exaggerate &mdash; interviewers verify, and lies surface during reference checks</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"color: #C00000;\">NEVER check your phone or watch &mdash; it signals disinterest</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"color: #C00000;\">NEVER ask about salary or benefits in the first round (unless they bring it up)</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"color: #C00000;\">NEVER give one-word answers &mdash; every answer is an opportunity to demonstrate value</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>After the Interview</h3>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Send a thank-you email within 24 hours &mdash; reference a specific point from the conversation</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Reflect on what went well and what you would answer differently next time</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Follow up politely if you have not heard back by the date they mentioned</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Keep applying elsewhere &mdash; never put all your energy on one interview</p>\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm 4.0pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->Whether selected or not, ask for feedback &mdash; it sharpens every future interview</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-left: solid #C9A84C 1.5pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt; background: #DEEAF1;\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 15.0pt; background: #DEEAF1; border: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #C9A84C 1.5pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; color: #1A1A2E;\">🏆 The Final Word: </span></strong><em><span style=\"color: #1A1A2E;\">An interview is a two-way evaluation. You are not begging for a job &mdash; you are assessing whether this company is the right environment for your skills and growth, just as they assess whether you fit their team. Walk in with that mindset and your confidence will be natural, not forced. Prepare thoroughly, speak clearly, stay authentic &mdash; and the right opportunity will come.</span></em></p>\n</div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-bottom: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">\n<h1 style=\"border: none; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">Chapter 11: 30 Life Lessons Every Professional Must Internalize</h1>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt;\">These lessons extend beyond interview preparation &mdash; they shape the kind of professional and person you become over a lifetime of work and leadership.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 468.0pt; margin-left: -.35pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"624\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">#</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Life Lesson</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Professional Application</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Always be honest, even when it is hard.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Interviewers and colleagues respect honesty far more than a perfect-sounding story.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Take responsibility for your actions.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Own your mistakes in interviews &mdash; it shows maturity and trustworthiness.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">3</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Hard work beats talent when talent is lazy.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Consistent effort separates good performers from great ones over time.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">4</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Respect everyone, regardless of status.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">From the receptionist to the CEO &mdash; how you treat everyone is who you are.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">5</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Control your emotions &mdash; don\'t let them control you.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stay calm in tough interview moments; do not show frustration or desperation.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Saying no is a strength, not a weakness.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Know your non-negotiables and communicate them professionally.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">7</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Keep your word &mdash; it defines your character.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Follow through on every commitment you make in an interview or workplace.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">8</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Failure is just a lesson, not the end.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Every rejected interview is preparation for the one that succeeds.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">9</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Choose friends who lift you up.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">In the workplace: collaborate with people who bring out your best.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">10</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stand up for yourself with confidence.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Negotiate confidently. Know your value and communicate it.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">11</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Listen more than you speak.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">In interviews and at work &mdash; listening first builds stronger relationships.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">12</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Apologize when you are wrong.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Admitting a mistake quickly and genuinely is a sign of professional strength.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">13</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Never stop learning and growing.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">The best professionals are always the most curious ones in the room.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">14</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Money is important, but integrity is priceless.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Build a reputation that money cannot buy and no one can take away.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">15</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Treat everyone with respect and kindness.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">You are always being evaluated &mdash; even when you think no one is watching.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">16</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Be humble, but don\'t let people walk over you.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Confidence and humility together are the most powerful professional combination.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 17;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">17</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Your time is valuable &mdash; spend it wisely.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Guard your focus fiercely. Time is the one resource you cannot recover.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 18;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">18</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Don\'t be afraid to take calculated risks.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">The best career opportunities rarely come with guarantees.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 19;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">19</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Health is wealth &mdash; take care of yourself.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Sustained high performance is only possible with physical and mental health.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 20;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">20</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Speak up for what is right, even alone.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Professional integrity sometimes requires courage to stand alone.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 21;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">26</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Confidence comes from preparation.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">The most confident people in any interview are the most prepared ones.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 22;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">29</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stay true to yourself, no matter what.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Be authentic in interviews &mdash; the right role is the one that fits the real you.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 23; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 30.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">30</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"213\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Real strength is in kindness, not power.</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 278.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"371\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">The best leaders build others up rather than asserting dominance.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"mso-element: para-border-div; border: none; border-bottom: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">\n<h1 style=\"border: none; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid #C00000 1.0pt; padding: 0cm; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;\">Summary &mdash; Your Interview Preparation Roadmap</h1>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6.0pt;\">This guide covers everything you need to walk into any interview with full confidence. Here is your action plan:</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 468.0pt; margin-left: -.35pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm .5pt 0cm .5pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid windowtext; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid windowtext;\" border=\"1\" width=\"624\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Chapter</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Topic</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #1A1A2E; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: white;\">Key Takeaway</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Introduce Yourself Like a CEO</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6-part framework: Intro &rarr; Background &rarr; Strengths &rarr; Achievements &rarr; Goals &rarr; Why This Role</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">2</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">HR Trap Questions</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Understand the hidden agenda. Answer the real question being asked, not just the surface one.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">3</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Answers That Hit Different</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Be sharp, specific, and confident. Memorable answers use outcomes, not vague claims.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">4</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Killer Curveball Questions</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stay calm. Turn surprises into opportunities to show character and resilience.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">5</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">What Interviewers Judge</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Your tone, specificity, how you talk about others, and your energy all signal your character.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">80 Interview Phrases</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Upgrade your language. Professional phrases change how interviewers perceive your value.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">7</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">17 WHY Questions</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Every WHY answer should connect to: the role, the company, or your growth.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">8</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Level Up English</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">13 everyday phrase upgrades that make you sound polished and professional.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">9</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Professional Email Templates</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Goodbye emails and post-interview thank-you emails that leave lasting impressions.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">10</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Pre-Interview Checklist</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: #F2F2F2; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1 week, 1 day, day-of, during, and after &mdash; preparation at every stage wins.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.0pt; border: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">11</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 125.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"167\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">30 Life Lessons</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 308.0pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; border-right: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid #CCCCCC .25pt; background: white; padding: 4.0pt 6.0pt 4.0pt 6.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"411\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Character and integrity are the foundation of a long, respected professional career.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 20.0pt; text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><em><span style=\"color: #666666;\">&mdash; Compiled by Krishnakumar | Worktual Innovations | Chennai, India | July 2026 &mdash;</span></em></p>\n</header></header>','2026-07-04 12:07:29','InterviewManagement',NULL,0,0),
(188,'Complete Guide to Multi-Tenant Architecture','complete-guide-to-multitenant-architecture','<h1 id=\"da60\" class=\"pw-post-title ge gf gg z gh gi gj gk gl gm gn go gp gq gr gs gt gu gv gw gx gy gz ha hb hc hd he hf hg cc\" data-testid=\"storyTitle\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Complete Guide to Multi-Tenant Architecture</h1>\n<p id=\"dcc1\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Building a multi-tenant application has become an increasingly important concept in today&rsquo;s application development that requires careful consideration of various architectural and operational factors.</p>\n<div class=\"mv am\">\n<div class=\"e\"><a class=\"as x au ci aw ab ax i ac ae af ag ah ai aj am\" href=\"https://medium.com/write?source=promotion_paragraph---post_body_banner_jsw_scribble--d69b24b518d6---------------------------------------\" rel=\"noopener follow\" data-discover=\"true\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fit:0/530397dcffdf36d7106323ffa97d70e11647a73aa57ffc10e5cc9e2ee93806eb\" media=\"(max-width: 551.98px)\"><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fit:0/530397dcffdf36d7106323ffa97d70e11647a73aa57ffc10e5cc9e2ee93806eb\" media=\"(min-width: 552px) and (max-width: 727.98px)\"><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fit:0/68fb8097f49d5324a408977f181945847db81f5ea78adab603a5c4f7e938464e\" media=\"(min-width: 728px) and (max-width: 903.98px)\"><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fit:0/68fb8097f49d5324a408977f181945847db81f5ea78adab603a5c4f7e938464e\" media=\"(min-width: 904px) and (max-width: 1079.98px)\"><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fit:0/68fb8097f49d5324a408977f181945847db81f5ea78adab603a5c4f7e938464e\" media=\"(min-width: 1080px)\"></picture></a></div>\n</div>\n<p id=\"61a2\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma mc md me mg mh mi mk ml mm mo mp mq ms mt mv mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">This guide will dive deeply into the complete understanding of multi-tenancy, exploring the different models, their advantages and disadvantages, key considerations for implementation, and best practices to ensure a successful deployment. By the end of this article, you will have a comprehensive understanding of how to navigate the multi-tenant landscape effectively.</p>\n<figure class=\"mz na nb nc nd ne mw mx paragraph-image\">\n<div class=\"nf ng bb nh bz ni\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\"><span class=\"be bf bg i bh bi bj bk bl speechify-ignore\">Press enter or click to view image in full size</span>\n<div class=\"mw mx my\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 1400w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" data-testid=\"og\"><img class=\"bz lg nj nk\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/1*XmnP1AhtKju4sI6Ye3nqRg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"232\" loading=\"eager\"></picture></div>\n</div>\n<figcaption class=\"nl nm nn mw mx no np z b by u w\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"z nq\">Fig. 1 Types of Multi-Tenant Architectures</strong></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2 id=\"b55c\" class=\"nr ns gg z nq nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">What is Multi-Tenant Architecture ?</h2>\n<p id=\"cce7\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Multi-tenancy is a software architecture that allows a single application to serve multiple customers, known as tenants. Each tenant&rsquo;s data and settings are kept separate and secure from one another. This approach is especially popular in Software as a Service (SaaS) applications, where it&rsquo;s crucial to operate efficiently and keep costs low. By using multi-tenancy, companies can provide their services to many users without needing to create separate applications for each one, making it a smart choice for both businesses and their customers.</p>\n<h2 id=\"f743\" class=\"nr ns gg z nq nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">How Does Multi-Tenant Architecture Work?</h2>\n<h2 id=\"fa55\" class=\"nr ns gg z nq nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Types of Multi-Tenant Architectures</h2>\n<p id=\"b4dc\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">There are several architectural models for implementing multi-tenancy, each with its unique characteristics:</p>\n<h3 id=\"e43c\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">1. Shared Database Model</h3>\n<p id=\"5dab\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">In the shared database model, all tenants share a single database instance. Each record in the database includes a tenant identifier to ensure data isolation.</p>\n<figure class=\"mz na nb nc nd ne mw mx paragraph-image\">\n<div class=\"mw mx pk\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:654/format:webp/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 654w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"auto, (min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 327px\"><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:654/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png 654w\" sizes=\"auto, (min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 327px\" data-testid=\"og\"><img class=\"bz lg nj nk\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:327/1*2CIMWqbkM1YauwKAox33NA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"381\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div>\n<figcaption class=\"nl nm nn mw mx no np z b by u w\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"z nq\">Fig.2 Shared Database Model</strong></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h3 id=\"2933\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Pros:</h3>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"42dc\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Simplicity:</strong>&nbsp;Managing one database instance is significantly easier than managing multiple databases. Schema changes can be applied universally.</li>\n<li id=\"9459\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Cost-Effectiveness:</strong>&nbsp;Shared resources reduce infrastructure costs, making this model appealing for startups and smaller companies.</li>\n<li id=\"c081\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Easier Maintenance:</strong>&nbsp;Updates and patches can be applied once to the shared database, simplifying maintenance tasks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6302\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Cons:</h3>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"1b82\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Data Leakage Risks:</strong>&nbsp;There is an inherent risk of accidentally exposing one tenant&rsquo;s data to another. This necessitates robust query filtering and access control mechanisms.</li>\n<li id=\"58bb\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Noisy Neighbor Problem:&nbsp;</strong>Performance can degrade if one tenant generates excessive load, affecting other tenants sharing the same resources.</li>\n<li id=\"4de0\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Complex Query Logic:</strong>&nbsp;Developers must always include tenant identifiers in their queries, which can complicate code and lead to potential errors.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"618a\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">2. Database Per Tenant Model</h3>\n<p id=\"1094\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">In this model, each tenant has its own dedicated database instance. This approach ensures complete data isolation.</p>\n<figure class=\"mz na nb nc nd ne mw mx paragraph-image\">\n<div class=\"mw mx pt\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/format:webp/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/format:webp/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/format:webp/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/format:webp/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/format:webp/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/format:webp/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:498/format:webp/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 498w\" type=\"image/webp\" sizes=\"auto, (min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 249px\"><source srcset=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:640/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 640w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:720/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 720w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:750/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 750w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:786/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 786w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:828/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 828w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1100/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 1100w, https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:498/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png 498w\" sizes=\"auto, (min-resolution: 4dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 4) and (max-width: 700px) 50vw, (min-resolution: 3dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 67vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (max-width: 700px) 65vw, (min-resolution: 2.5dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2.5) and (max-width: 700px) 80vw, (min-resolution: 2dppx) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 249px\" data-testid=\"og\"><img class=\"bz lg nj nk\" role=\"presentation\" src=\"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:249/1*fXk8xqIi-yM8as2kddQCDA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"249\" height=\"304\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div>\n<figcaption class=\"nl nm nn mw mx no np z b by u w\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"z nq\">Fig. 3 Database Per Tenant Model</strong></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h3 id=\"2360\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Pros:</h3>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"c1e9\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Enhanced Security:&nbsp;</strong>With separate databases, the risk of data leakage is virtually eliminated.</li>\n<li id=\"14e4\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Performance Isolation:&nbsp;</strong>Tenants cannot impact each other&rsquo;s performance since they operate on distinct databases.</li>\n<li id=\"8cf6\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Easier Customization:&nbsp;</strong>Different tenants can have customized schemas or configurations without affecting others.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7771\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Cons:</h3>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"eb87\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Increased Complexity:&nbsp;</strong>Managing multiple databases can become cumbersome, especially as the number of tenants grows.</li>\n<li id=\"20f0\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Higher Costs:&nbsp;</strong>Infrastructure costs may rise due to the need for additional database instances.</li>\n<li id=\"3a9e\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Complicated Schema Changes:&nbsp;</strong>Any schema changes must be replicated across all tenant databases, which can be labor-intensive and error-prone.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2f61\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">3. Hybrid Model</h3>\n<p id=\"5c51\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">A hybrid approach combines elements of both shared and separate databases. For example, some tenants may share a database while others have dedicated instances based on their specific needs.</p>\n<h3 id=\"2d8c\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Pros:</h3>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"cf75\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Flexibility:&nbsp;</strong>This model allows for resource sharing where appropriate while maintaining isolation for sensitive or high-load tenants.</li>\n<li id=\"edc8\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Scalability:</strong>&nbsp;It provides options for scaling resources based on tenant requirements without committing fully to one model or the other.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9e10\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"ax\">Cons:</strong></h3>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"6df3\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Complex Management:</strong>&nbsp;The hybrid model can introduce complexity in managing different types of databases and ensuring consistent performance across them.</li>\n<li id=\"9c45\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Potential for Confusion:&nbsp;</strong>Developers must clearly understand which tenants are on shared resources versus dedicated ones to avoid misconfiguration.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"fc78\" class=\"nr ns gg z nq nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"ax\">Key Considerations for Multi-Tenant Applications</strong></h2>\n<p id=\"f3fe\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">When designing a multi-tenant application, several critical factors should be considered:</p>\n<h3 id=\"fd80\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">1. Security</h3>\n<p id=\"fb2e\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Security is paramount in any multi-tenant architecture. Consider implementing:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"bbc1\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Data Encryption:&nbsp;</strong>Use encryption both at rest and in transit to protect sensitive tenant data.</li>\n<li id=\"1778\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Access Controls:&nbsp;</strong>Implement strict access controls to ensure that only authorized users can access specific data sets.</li>\n<li id=\"c789\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">-<strong class=\"lz gh\">Regular Audits:&nbsp;</strong>Conduct regular security audits and penetration testing to identify vulnerabilities.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3ea0\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">2. Scalability</h3>\n<p id=\"61f6\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Your architecture should support scalability as your user base grows:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"6410\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Load Balancing:</strong>&nbsp;Use load balancers to distribute traffic evenly across servers, preventing any single point from becoming overwhelmed.</li>\n<li id=\"890a\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Cloud Infrastructure:</strong>&nbsp;Consider leveraging cloud services that allow for dynamic scaling based on demand.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9a78\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">3. Performance Management</h3>\n<p id=\"fbf3\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">To mitigate issues related to performance:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"85bd\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Resource Quotas:</strong>&nbsp;Implement resource quotas per tenant to prevent any single tenant from monopolizing resources.</li>\n<li id=\"b22a\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Monitoring Tools:</strong>&nbsp;Utilize monitoring tools to track performance metrics and identify potential bottlenecks before they impact users.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"89f0\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">4. Customization Capabilities</h3>\n<p id=\"6f84\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Allowing tenants some degree of customization can enhance user satisfaction:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"a1d0\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Configurable Features:</strong>&nbsp;Enable tenants to customize features or settings within the application without affecting others.</li>\n<li id=\"8c8f\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">API Access:</strong>&nbsp;Provide APIs that allow tenants to integrate their systems or extend functionalities as needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"8726\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">5. Maintenance and Upgrades</h3>\n<p id=\"d4e0\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Efficiently managing maintenance and upgrades is crucial:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"b9ee\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Automated Deployment Tools:</strong>&nbsp;Use CI/CD pipelines to automate deployment processes across multiple tenant environments.</li>\n<li id=\"b890\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\"><strong class=\"lz gh\">Version Control:&nbsp;</strong>Implement version control strategies that allow you to roll out changes gradually or revert if issues arise.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"5697\" class=\"nr ns gg z nq nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Best Practices for Multi-Tenant Applications</h2>\n<p id=\"cadf\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">To ensure success in your multi-tenancy implementation, consider these best practices:</p>\n<h3 id=\"8c30\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">1. Design for Isolation</h3>\n<p id=\"e1dd\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Regardless of your chosen architecture, always prioritize data isolation. Even in shared environments, implement robust filtering mechanisms that enforce tenant boundaries at every level &ndash; application logic, database queries, and network access.</p>\n<h3 id=\"db95\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">2. Use Global Unique Identifiers (GUIDs)</h3>\n<p id=\"f7f5\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">If you opt for a shared database model, use globally unique identifiers (GUIDs) for primary keys across all tables. This practice prevents key collisions when migrating tenants between databases or merging data sets.</p>\n<h3 id=\"9bbc\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">3. Implement Tenant Awareness in Your Application</h3>\n<p id=\"a225\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Ensure your application is designed with tenant awareness at its core:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"cf4c\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Use middleware or service layers that automatically inject tenant information into requests.</li>\n<li id=\"b04b\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma po mc md me pp mg mh mi pq mk ml mm pr mo mp mq ps ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Maintain context about which tenant is making requests throughout your application stack.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"a8fc\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">4. Plan for Data Migration</h3>\n<p id=\"8331\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Design your application with future migrations in mind:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"5773\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Create scripts or tools that facilitate easy migration of tenant data between shared and dedicated resources when necessary.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"241f\" class=\"ot ns gg z nq ou ov ow nw ox oy oz oa mi pa pb pc mm pd pe pf mq pg ph pi pj cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">5. Regularly Review Architecture Decisions</h3>\n<p id=\"e73b\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">As your application grows and evolves, periodically review your architecture decisions:</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li id=\"fbae\" class=\"lx ly gg lz b ma mb mc md me mf mg mh mi mj mk ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu pl pm pn cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Assess whether your current model still meets your needs as you acquire new tenants or experience changes in usage patterns.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"e48d\" class=\"nr ns gg z nq nt nu nv nw nx ny nz oa ob oc od oe of og oh oi oj ok ol om on cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Conclusion</h2>\n<p id=\"c1e4\" class=\"pw-post-body-paragraph lx ly gg lz b ma oo mc md me op mg mh mi oq mk ml mm or mo mp mq os ms mt mu fz cc\" data-selectable-paragraph=\"\">Building a multi-tenancy architecture involves navigating a complex landscape filled with trade-offs between simplicity, security, performance, and cost-effectiveness. The choice between shared databases, dedicated databases per tenant, or a hybrid approach will largely depend on your specific use case, anticipated growth, security requirements, and operational capabilities.</p>','2026-07-27 09:31:57','Databases',NULL,0,0),
(189,'Multi-Agent AI Systems','multi-agent-ai-systems','<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgKEAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span data-subtree=\"aimfl\" data-processed=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Multi-Agent AI Systems (MAS)</span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> <mark class=\"HxTRcb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"VREyDb_o\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjV19HL8P6VAxWGkOEIHR8EHdYQuJAPeggIAggBCAoQAQ\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--qkimaf VREyDb_n/HugV6--><!--cqw1tb VREyDb_n/HugV6-->represent a paradigm shift from single, all-purpose Large Language Models (LLMs) to network-based architectures of specialized AI agents working together<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></mark>. This design addresses the core limitations of single models, such as limited context windows, tool overload, and vulnerability to catastrophic reasoning failures. By breaking down complex workflows into isolated, collaborative roles, multi-agent networks achieve greater parallel processing, modularity, and runtime fault tolerance. [<a href=\"https://www.scaler.com/topics/multi-agent-systems-ai-what-it-is/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=product&amp;prds=pvt:hg,productid:83151983566484777&amp;ibp=oshop\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.lyzr.ai/blog/multi-agent-architecture/\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://airia.com/blog/multi-agent-ai-systems-enterprise-architecture/\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://medium.com/@kuldeep.paul08/multi-agent-ai-systems-architecture-challenges-and-building-reliable-solutions-b7781b361f9e\">5</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<hr class=\"j3tEEe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-pl=\"|||[]\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 32px 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(128, 128, 128);\">\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div class=\"otQkpb\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" data-animation-nesting=\"\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Foundational Concepts<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgNEAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">To understand how multi-agent networks operate, it helps to examine the five structural layers that govern their autonomy, information handling, and execution tracking: [<a href=\"https://www.lyzr.ai/blog/multi-agent-architecture/\">1</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<div class=\"r1PmQe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-wiz-uids=\"VREyDb_1d,VREyDb_1c\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgOEAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 4px 0px 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\n<div data-processed=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\n<div class=\"pHpOfb\" data-animation-atomic=\"\" data-sae=\"\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1.33333px solid rgb(248, 248, 250);\">\n<div class=\"pCTyYe\" dir=\"ltr\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\n<pre data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 14px 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><code data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"undefined\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    Reasoning Layer                     │\n│         (Specialized Agents &amp; Persona Prompts)         │\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\n                            ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   Orchestration Layer                  │\n│       (Control Flow, Handoffs, &amp; Routing Rules)       │\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\n                            ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   Protocol Layer                       │\n│        (MCP for Data/Tools ─── A2A for Peers)          │\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\n                            ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     Memory Layer                       │\n│       (Short-term States &amp; Long-term RAG/Vector)       │\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\n                            ▼\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    Execution Layer                     │\n│          (External APIs, Databases, Sandbox)           │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;unset&quot;,&quot;┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    Reasoning Layer                     │\\n│         (Specialized Agents \\u0026 Persona Prompts)         │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                   Orchestration Layer                  │\\n│       (Control Flow, Handoffs, \\u0026 Routing Rules)       │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                   Protocol Layer                       │\\n│        (MCP for Data/Tools ─── A2A for Peers)          │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                     Memory Layer                       │\\n│       (Short-term States \\u0026 Long-term RAG/Vector)       │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    Execution Layer                     │\\n│          (External APIs, Databases, Sandbox)           │\\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n&quot;,[[&quot;┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    Reasoning Layer                     │\\n│         (Specialized Agents \\u0026 Persona Prompts)         │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                   Orchestration Layer                  │\\n│       (Control Flow, Handoffs, \\u0026 Routing Rules)       │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                   Protocol Layer                       │\\n│        (MCP for Data/Tools ─── A2A for Peers)          │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                     Memory Layer                       │\\n│       (Short-term States \\u0026 Long-term RAG/Vector)       │\\n└───────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\\n                            ▼\\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    Execution Layer                     │\\n│          (External APIs, Databases, Sandbox)           │\\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n&quot;,0]]]]--></div>\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjV19HL8P6VAxWGkOEIHR8EHdYQ-7AUeggIAggBCBIQAA\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEAA\" data-processed=\"true\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEAI\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Role Specialization<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Instead of using one prompt for an entire operation, developers break workflows into narrow, discrete roles (e.g., Researcher, Editor, Compliance Checker). Each agent operates under its own system persona, fine-tuned instructions, and strict success metrics.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.lyzr.ai/blog/multi-agent-architecture/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=product&amp;prds=pvt:hg,productid:83151983566484777&amp;ibp=oshop\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://abvijaykumar.medium.com/multi-agent-architectures-e09c53c7fe0d\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://75way.com/blog/build-multi-agent-system-in-azure-ai-foundry\">4</a>]<span data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEAc\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">State Management &amp; Shared Memory<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Workflows rely on an overarching state container. This container tracks execution histories, preserves local working variables, and moves context systematically from one node to the next.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.lyzr.ai/blog/multi-agent-architecture/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://airia.com/blog/multi-agent-ai-systems-enterprise-architecture/\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://codelabs.developers.google.com/codelabs/production-ready-ai-roadshow/1-building-a-multi-agent-system/building-a-multi-agent-system\">3</a>]<span data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEAw\" data-sae=\"\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Standardized Communication Protocols<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Agents rely on standardized protocols to navigate data systems and coordinate with peers:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span>\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjV19HL8P6VAxWGkOEIHR8EHdYQ-7AUeggIAggBCBIQDQ\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEA0\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEA4\" data-sae=\"\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Model Context Protocol (MCP)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>: A vertical protocol used to securely connect models directly to data sources, files, and underlying developer tools.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEA8\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><em class=\"eujQNb\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Agent-to-Agent Protocol (A2A)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em>: A horizontal protocol allowing separate agents to negotiate, delegate tasks, and route messages directly to one another.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.lyzr.ai/blog/multi-agent-architecture/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=product&amp;prds=pvt:hg,productid:16257546018563779695,catalogid:15080397643525503589,gpcid:12732676780290261372,mid:576462894024501302&amp;ibp=oshop\">2</a>, <a href=\"https://www.scaler.com/topics/multi-agent-systems-ai-what-it-is/\">3</a>, <a href=\"https://blog.n8n.io/multi-agent-systems/\">4</a>, <a href=\"https://onereach.ai/blog/power-of-multi-agent-ai-open-protocols/\">5</a>]<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\n<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\n<span data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-hveid=\"CAIIAQgSEBQ\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">Distributed Error Correction<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>: Single agents suffer from catastrophic failure if a single reasoning step fails. Multi-agent systems run self-correcting loops (such as Critic-Refiner steps) where a supervisor agent detects hallucinations or missing data and triggers localized updates without restarting the wider pipeline.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> [<a href=\"https://www.scaler.com/topics/multi-agent-systems-ai-what-it-is/\">1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.lyzr.ai/blog/multi-agent-architecture/\">2</a>]<span data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\n<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\n<hr class=\"j3tEEe\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-pl=\"|||[]\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 32px 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(128, 128, 128);\">\n<div class=\"Fsg96\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-siz